	(text "Pack chain per spec §5. Rev FET and OVP FET are back-to-back AO3415As, common source on CELL_RB.\nOVP FET off by default: R802 10M holds its gate at the source, C801 sits gate-to-source (never to GND),\nU801 pulls the gate down through R803 470k (tau = 32 ms, >= 25 ms at -10 %); D804 speeds turn-off.\nD802/D803 clamp VGS to ~6.2 V (AO3415A is +/-8 V; a 14500 pair is 8.4 V). U801 MR and CT float (TPS3840 pin table).\nR806 330k bleeds CELL+ (8.5 uA at 2.8 V): a charged pack node let C801 hold Q802 on, so a 14500 swapped in within\n~2-4 s reached VBAT (ngspice, 2026-09-15); with R806 the window is ~0.5 s. Core pack inputs keep CIN at 1 uF.\nJ_BAT pinout is mirror-symmetric (PACK+, GND, GND, PACK+): an end-reversed cable still lands + on +.\nThe 10M gate node needs residue-free assembly."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
